摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A shared data backend for AI agents and authorized teams.","id":"gh:1290802262","install_available":false,"language":"Shell","name":"goalfydata","slug":"GoalfyAI/goalfydata","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agents","ai-agents-automation","claude-code","codex","data-apps","data-assets","data-governance","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","goalfydata","mcp","mcp-tools","model-context-protocol"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A shared data backend for AI agents and authorized teams."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"A shared place for AI agents to build, update, analyze, and reuse business data."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Turn spreadsheets, APIs, databases, and agent outputs into reusable datasets and data apps"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"that preserve business context and stay up to date."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Website"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Get Started"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Documentation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Understand GoalfyData in 30 Seconds"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Codex, Claude Code, Manus, and other connected agents can create datasets, write update scripts, ana"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"lyze results, and build data apps. GoalfyData keeps the resulting data together with its field defin"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"itions, metric definitions, table relationships, permissions, and governance rules."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The result is a durable data asset that can be reused across conversations, agents, devices, and tea"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ms. Import data, run SQL analysis, schedule updates, share with controlled access, and deploy data a"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"pps from the same dataset. When the dataset updates, connected apps continue to read the latest data"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ps from the same dataset. When the dataset updates, connected apps continue to read the latest data."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The fastest path is to open the integration page for your platform, copy its setup instructions, and"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" give them to your agent. Create your API Key in GoalfyData Settings; keys use the `gfk_` prefix and"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" are shown only once."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Platform | Fastest setup | Detailed guide | Status |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| **Codex** | Open the Codex integration and send the setup text to Codex | Codex Quick Start | Avai"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"lable |\n| **Claude Code** | Open the Claude Code integration and send the setup text to Claude Code "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"| Claude Code Quick Start | Available |\n| **Manus** | Open the Manus integration, then add the MCP c"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"onnector and upload the Skill in Manus | Manus Quick Start | Available |\n| **Other Agents / Generic "},{"id":"p14s5","text":"MCP** | Connect the remote MCP and load the generic Skill | Generic Integration Guide | Available fo"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"r compatible MCP/CLI agents |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> Manus setup currently requires manual steps in its web interface; it cannot be completed by pastin"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"g an install runbook into a Manus conversation."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Minimal manual CLI setup"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"For macOS or Linux developers who prefer manual setup:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Then follow the platform guide above to install the Skill/plugin and connect MCP. The detailed guide"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"s cover Windows, updates, key rotation, and troubleshooting. A successful connection exposes 20 Goal"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"fyData MCP tools, including `uds_query` and `uds_dataset_manage`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## How AI Agents Create and Reuse Data Assets with GoalfyData"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"CSV files give an agent rows and columns. Prompts give it instructions for one conversation. Neither"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" preserves the structure, definitions, relationships, and business rules another agent needs to cont"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"inue the work later. GoalfyData turns that missing context into a reusable data asset."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 2. Tell your agent what you want to build"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Start with the business outcome and data you need. For example:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"> Help me scrape today's recommended AI tools and categories on GitHub."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Your agent can work out the required sources, tables, field relationships, and metrics, then collect"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" or prepare the data. You can also provide an Excel or CSV file, or connect sources such as Google A"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"nalytics 4 (GA4) and Google Search Console (GSC)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Want to try the workflow yourself? Click the file title below to download the example files, then gi"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ve them to your agent and describe the data asset you want to build."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- EXAMPLE Ecommerce Data — simulated Amazon, Shopify, Meta Ads, returns, and SKU cost data for two w"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"eekly reporting periods"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For other ready-to-use datasets, email goalfydata@goalfyai.com."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Core Capabilities"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Capability | What it enables |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| **Data import and hosting** | Turn spreadsheets, CSV files, APIs, databases, and agent outputs int"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"o hosted datasets |\n| **Business context** | Preserve field meanings, metric definitions, table rela"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"tionships, processing rules, and usage guidance |\n| **SQL and agent analysis** | Query and analyze g"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"overned datasets through the CLI and MCP tools |\n| **Managed Refresh** | Run scheduled update script"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"s in an isolated environment, with logs and failure status |\n| **Controlled sharing** | Share datase"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"ts and results with teammates, clients, and authorized agents using permissions |\n| **Data App Deplo"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"yment** | Deploy dashboards and lightweight apps that continue to read the latest dataset data |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"GoalfyData organizes the lifecycle around **Build → Run → Share**."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Stage | What happens | Result |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| **Build** | Agents create datasets, update scripts, analyses, and apps from files, APIs, databases"},{"id":"p35s2","text":", or spreadsheets | An understandable data asset with business context |\n| **Run** | GoalfyData host"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"s datasets and runs scheduled updates with version and status information | Data stays available and"},{"id":"p35s4","text":" up to date |\n| **Share** | Teams grant controlled access to datasets and apps | People and agents r"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"euse the same governed result |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## What This Repository Contains"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"This repository provides the client-side materials needed to connect agents to GoalfyData:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- Codex and Claude Code plugins, Skills, MCP configuration, and agent-executable install runbooks\n- "},{"id":"p38s2","text":"Manus and generic-agent Skill packages\n- Platform quick-start guides, examples, update instructions,"},{"id":"p38s3","text":" and troubleshooting documentation\n- Community, contribution, security, and license files"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"GoalfyData datasets, Managed Refresh, permission sharing, and Data App Deployment are provided by th"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"e hosted GoalfyData service. Cloning this repository installs none of those server-side services and"},{"id":"p39s3","text":" is **not** a self-hosted GoalfyData deployment."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## What GoalfyData Is Not"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"GoalfyData does not replace your AI agent, operational database, spreadsheet, or BI tool. It provide"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"s the reusable data asset layer that lets connected agents preserve business context, keep data upda"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"ted, and share results safely."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Community and Security"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| Entry | What to submit |"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| Report a Bug | Confirmed bugs, installation failures, integration issues, or regressions |\n| Ask a"},{"id":"p44s2","text":" Question | Setup, usage, and troubleshooting questions |\n| Suggest an Idea | New integrations and p"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"roduct ideas |\n| Share a Use Case | Agent workflows, business scenarios, and demos |\n| Security Poli"},{"id":"p44s4","text":"cy | How to report a vulnerability privately |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
